sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Producer as Producer<br/>batch-gateway / job (producer lib)
    participant Broker as Broker<br/>Redis 6379/TCP RESP (opt. TLS)<br/>or Postgres 5432/TCP or Pub/Sub 443/TCP
    participant AP as llm-d-async<br/>Async Processor
    participant Prom as Prometheus / EPP metrics<br/>HTTP per URL
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway<br/>llm-d-router / EPP<br/>HTTP/HTTPS per igw_base_url
    participant VLLM as vLLM pool<br/>8000/TCP (typical)
    participant OTLP as OTLP collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over AP,Broker: Startup (sql transport): apply schema migrations<br/>5432/TCP, SQL_URL credentials
    AP->>K8s: Load REST config (ctrl.GetConfigOrDie)<br/>SA token, TLS 1.2+

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Producer,VLLM: Flow 1: Async request dispatch (redis-sortedset)
    Producer->>Broker: Enqueue request (id, deadline, metadata)<br/>Redis password
    AP->>Broker: Poll / claim (lease, 300s TTL)<br/>REDIS_URL credentials
    Broker-->>AP: Request message
    AP->>Prom: Budget / saturation query (PromQL or scrape)<br/>No auth
    Prom-->>AP: Free capacity estimate
    Note over AP: Queue gates (Refuse/Drop) → merge policy →<br/>pool gates (Wait up to --gate-wait-timeout)
    AP->>IGW: POST igw_base_url + /v1/completions<br/>x-llm-d-inference-fairness-id, x-llm-d-inference-objective<br/>Plain HTTP or TLS 1.2+ / optional mTLS client cert
    IGW->>VLLM: Route to model server (gateway-defined)
    VLLM-->>IGW: Completion
    IGW-->>AP: 200 response
    AP->>Broker: Write result keyed by id
    Producer->>Broker: Read result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Note over AP,IGW: Flow 2: Retry / deadline handling
    IGW-->>AP: 429 / 5xx / x-llm-d-request-dropped-reason<br/>or transient transport error
    alt Deadline not passed
        AP->>Broker: Re-enqueue with exponential backoff
    else Deadline passed
        AP->>Broker: Write DEADLINE_EXCEEDED error result
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Prom,OTLP: Flow 4: Observability
    Prom->>AP: Scrape GET /metrics 9090/TCP HTTP<br/>No auth (chart default)
    opt --metrics-endpoint-auth=true
        AP->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    end
    AP->>OTLP: Export traces, plaintext gRPC (chart default)
    end
